### Requests for the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### Start the backend first: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
@host = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- Whole periods ----------

### Q1 2026, the figure reported in NOTES.md
### Revenue 37850.50, COGS 14272.75, gross profit 23577.75,
### operating expenses 68100.07, operating income -44522.32, other income 42.18,
### net income -44480.14
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-03-31

### January: net income -21529.65
### Rent shows the full 9000.00 (JE-007, three months expensed when paid).
### 6300 Marketing (legacy) shows 2500.10 although the account is inactive (JE-008).
### The subscription billing of 12000.00 (JE-004) is balance sheet only and does not appear.
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-01-31

### February: net income -13230.25
### Product Revenue is 8200.00, not 16400.00: the duplicate JE-009 is void.
### Sales Returns & Discounts is -650.25 inside Revenue (JE-012).
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-02-01&end=2026-02-28

### March: net income -9720.24
### Salaries is 18500.00: the 5000.00 bonus JE-019 is a draft.
### Software is 1099.97: 1199.97 less the 100.00 vendor credit (JE-020).
### Interest Income 42.18 is under Other income, not Revenue.
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-01&end=2026-03-31

### Everything in the ledger: net income -30380.14 (5000.00 - 44480.14 + 9100.00)
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2025-12-15&end=2026-04-01

### ---------- Date boundaries ----------

### Single day, 2026-03-31: net income -17457.82 (1000.00 - 18500.00 + 42.18)
### Both ends are inclusive, so the three entries dated 03-31 appear.
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-31&end=2026-03-31

### Day before quarter end: all zeros, the 03-31 entries are out
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-21&end=2026-03-30

### December 2025: only JE-001, net income 5000.00
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2025-12-01&end=2025-12-31

### April 2026: only JE-024, net income 9100.00
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-04-01&end=2026-04-30

### ---------- Single entries ----------

### 2026-03-02: three-line sale with discount (JE-016) and its COGS (JE-017)
### Product Revenue 15000.00, Sales Returns & Discounts -150.00, COGS 6012.45
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-02&end=2026-03-02

### 2026-03-20: vendor credit alone (JE-020). Software -100.00, net income 100.00
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-20&end=2026-03-20

### ---------- No activity: 200 with empty sections and 0.00 totals ----------

### 2026-03-15: only the draft bonus JE-019
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-15&end=2026-03-15

### 2026-03-18: only the void, balance-sheet-only JE-025
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-18&end=2026-03-18

### 2026-02-15: only a cash receipt (JE-013), balance sheet accounts
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-02-15&end=2026-02-15

### 2027: nothing in the ledger
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2027-01-01&end=2027-12-31

### ---------- Invalid requests: each returns 400 with {"message": "..."} ----------

### start missing
GET {{host}}/income-statement?end=2026-03-31

### end missing
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-01-01

### Both missing
GET {{host}}/income-statement

### Month 13
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-13-01&end=2026-03-31

### Day that does not exist
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-02-30&end=2026-03-31

### Wrong format
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=01/01/2026&end=2026-03-31

### start after end
GET {{host}}/income-statement?start=2026-03-31&end=2026-01-01
